<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer-FAI Cup second-round draw.</title>
<headline>Soccer-FAI Cup second-round draw.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of draw for second round of Football Association of Ireland (FAI) 1997 senior challenge cup made on Thursday. All ties to be played on the week ending February 9, 1997.</p>
<p>Cork City versus St.Francis</p>
<p>Drogheda United versus Rockmount</p>
<p>Dublin University versus Bray Wanderers</p>
<p>Bohemians versus Wayside Celtic</p>
<p>Waterford United versus Shamrock Rovers</p>
<p>Sligo Rovers versus St.Patrick's Athletic</p>
<p>Shelbourne versus Dundalk</p>
<p>Derry City versus Home Farm/Everton</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 35-663377.</p>
</text>
